  "title": "Unified Title",
  "summary": "AdvDex and CHORD present a unified framework for learning Dexterous Manipulation from human and robot demonstrations, addressing challenges in scalability and transferability. AdvDex introduces a Vision-Language-Action (VLA) framework for dexterous manipulation with joint-aligned actions and domain-adversarial learning, while CHORD leverages object-centric contact wrench space guidance for robust, contact-rich manipulation.",
